==Trivia==
* {{TCG|Hala}} also exists in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but has a different effect.

===Origin===
*[[Hala]] is the [[Island kahuna|kahuna]] of [[Melemele Island]].
*{{p|Hariyama}} and {{p|Crabominable}} are Pokémon that Hala uses in {{game4|SMUSUM}}.

